Tokio Marine Kiln Syndicates Limited  Annual report and accounts 2018 101
During 2018 the gross technical provisions moved from £48.7m to £28.7m including:
£
£ reduction of the provision for unexpired risks to £3.3m (2017: £8.6m); 
£
£ reduction of unearned premiums provisions to £7.0m (2017: £19.0m);
£
£ reduction of an additional expense reserve for the run-off to £nil (2017: £1.1m);
£
£ no change to the UNFCU reserve of £7.7m (2017: £7.7m);
The general reduction in the technical provisions during 2018 is due to the run-off of the liabilities over time as Syndicate 308 is no 
longer writing new business. 

